# Local variables for `wrangler dev`. Copy to .dev.vars and uncomment what you need.
# Nothing here is required: MailCorgi generates its own master key on first boot.
# Every line stays commented so the Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for no secrets.
#
# APP_URL=http://localhost:8787
# CLOUD=true
# ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@example.com
# ALLOWED_EMAILS=friend@example.com
# WORKERS_PLAN=free
